{
  "total_duration": 756.414,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.36,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果你在很多人面前讲话，大家突然笑了，你会紧张吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 4.71,
      "end": 9.71,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "有时候，别人笑不是在嘲笑你，而是因为你讲得生动。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 10.06,
      "end": 18.543,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 很会"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "make a speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，他的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "sense of humour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "让婚礼上的人都笑了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 18.893,
      "end": 25.909,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是他的六岁女儿 Jenny 看不懂，她以为大家在"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laughing at him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 26.259,
      "end": 31.859,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天先抓住这个区别："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laugh with someone, not laugh at someone"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 32.209,
      "end": 35.729,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看 Jeremy 是一个怎样的大人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 36.079,
      "end": 42.199,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Jeremy Hampden 朋友很多，在聚会上很受欢迎。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 42.549,
      "end": 47.541,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文开头说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jeremy Hampden has a large circle of friends"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 47.89,
      "end": 54.154,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "circle"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是画一个圆，而是朋友圈、社交圈。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 54.504,
      "end": 58.392,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "and is very popular at parties"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 58.742,
      "end": 64.134,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Popular"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是受欢迎，说明大家喜欢和他在一起。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 64.484,
      "end": 72.052,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "大家为什么喜欢他？课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Everybody admires him for his great sense of humour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 72.402,
      "end": 77.193,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Admire him for"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后面说原因：因为他的幽默感。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 77.543,
      "end": 83.879,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但是有一个小小的例外："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "everybody, that is, except his six-year-old daughter, Jenny"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 84.229,
      "end": 91.069,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住：Jeremy 受欢迎，大家欣赏他的 humour，可 Jenny 还不懂这种大人的笑。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 91.419,
      "end": 95.099,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，看 Jeremy 为什么要在婚礼上讲话。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 95.449,
      "end": 101.369,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：最近，一个亲密朋友请 Jeremy 在婚礼宴会上致辞。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 101.719,
      "end": 107.915,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "one of Jeremy's closest friends asked him to make a speech at a wedding reception"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 108.264,
      "end": 114.288,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Wedding reception"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可以理解成婚礼仪式之后的聚会或宴会。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 114.638,
      "end": 122.198,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在一些英文场景里，朋友会"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "make a speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，说祝福，也讲轻松的小故事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 122.548,
      "end": 130.34,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对 Jeremy 来说，这不是可怕的事，课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "This is the sort of thing that Jeremy loves"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 130.69,
      "end": 134.946,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The sort of thing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是这类事情、这种活动。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 135.296,
      "end": 141.152,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他不是随便上台乱说，而是认真准备："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He prepared the speech carefully"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 141.501,
      "end": 146.533,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后他带着 Jenny 一起去婚礼："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "and went to the wedding with Jenny"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 146.883,
      "end": 153.763,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住：public speaking 可以准备，也可以练习；Jeremy 喜欢这种清楚表达的机会。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 154.113,
      "end": 158.953,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，看 speech 为什么成功，也看 Jenny 为什么不安。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 159.303,
      "end": 165.423,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Jeremy 在讲话里加入很多有趣的小故事，讲话大获成功。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 165.773,
      "end": 170.889,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He had included a large number of funny stories in the speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 171.239,
      "end": 178.59,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A large number of"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是很多；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "included"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是把这些故事放进 speech 里。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 178.94,
      "end": 182.804,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结果自然很好："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "it was a great success"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 183.154,
      "end": 187.514,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的笑声是友好的，客人是在享受他的 humour。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 187.864,
      "end": 194.456,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是 Jenny 的反应很快："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as he had finished, Jenny told him she wanted to go home"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 194.806,
      "end": 200.142,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是一......就......，让这个反应非常突然。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 200.491,
      "end": 205.027,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 有点失望："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jeremy was a little disappointed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 205.377,
      "end": 211.729,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但他没有责备 Jenny，而是照她说的做："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "he did as his daughter asked"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 212.079,
      "end": 217.759,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住：speech 是 success，可 Jenny 以为那种笑声有问题。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 218.109,
      "end": 222.469,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，笑点和温柔的误会出现了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 222.819,
      "end": 228.259,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：回家路上，Jeremy 问 Jenny 是否喜欢他的讲话。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 228.609,
      "end": 233.869,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "On the way home, he asked Jenny if she had enjoyed the speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 234.218,
      "end": 239.922,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "if"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是把一个 yes-no question 放进句子里。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 240.272,
      "end": 245.308,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "令 Jeremy 吃惊的是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "To his surprise, she said she hadn't"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 245.658,
      "end": 252.13,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "She hadn't"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "省掉了 enjoyed the speech，回答很短，也很干脆。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 252.48,
      "end": 257.296,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 问她为什么："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jeremy asked her why this was so"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 257.646,
      "end": 264.597,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jenny 的答案是整篇课文的 punchline："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "she did not like to see so many people laughing at him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 264.947,
      "end": 268.347,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jenny 不是坏，也不是笨，她只是想保护爸爸。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 268.697,
      "end": 276.137,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "大人知道客人是在"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laughing with him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "；Jenny 却以为他们在"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laughing at him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 276.487,
      "end": 284.007,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住：别人笑，不一定是在嘲笑你；有时是你的表达真的打动了他们。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 284.357,
      "end": 289.836,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，如果我在台上讲故事，大家笑了，我第一反应可能会紧张。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 290.186,
      "end": 294.362,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "很正常。你可能会想："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Are they laughing at me?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 294.712,
      "end": 297.73,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对，我会担心是不是自己说错了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 298.08,
      "end": 306.376,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但 laughter 有不同意思。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Laugh at someone"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是嘲笑；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laugh with someone"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是一起笑。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 306.726,
      "end": 313.21,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 的 speech 是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a great success"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，所以客人是在和他一起笑？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 313.559,
      "end": 318.199,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。他准备得认真，故事也讲得生动，大家的笑是友好的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 318.549,
      "end": 321.058,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那 Jenny 为什么不开心？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 321.408,
      "end": 327.008,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "她太小了，还分不清这两种笑。她看到很多人笑，就以为爸爸被嘲笑了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 327.358,
      "end": 330.29,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以 Jenny 其实是在担心爸爸？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 330.639,
      "end": 333.999,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是的。她的误会很可爱，也很温柔。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 334.349,
      "end": 338.352,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那这课也在鼓励我们练习 public speaking 吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 338.702,
      "end": 347.622,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。不管中文还是英文，先准备，再讲清楚，再观察听众反应。别人善意地笑，可能说明你讲得很好。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 347.972,
      "end": 352.124,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "我可以先从 class presentation 或讲一个小故事开始。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "start": 352.474,
      "end": 358.442,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly."
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Prepare carefully, speak clearly, and notice friendly laughter"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "start": 358.791,
      "end": 363.999,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jeremy Hampden has a large circle of friends and is very popular at parties."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 364.349,
      "end": 368.117,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Everybody admires him for his great sense of humour."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 368.467,
      "end": 372.907,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Everybody, that is, except his six-year-old daughter, Jenny."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 373.257,
      "end": 378.777,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Recently, one of Jeremy's closest friends asked him to make a speech at a wedding reception."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "start": 379.127,
      "end": 382.463,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "This is the sort of thing that Jeremy loves."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "start": 382.813,
      "end": 386.965,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He prepared the speech carefully and went to the wedding with Jenny."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "start": 387.315,
      "end": 393.483,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He had included a large number of funny stories in the speech and, of course, it was a great success."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "start": 393.832,
      "end": 398.128,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as he had finished, Jenny told him she wanted to go home."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 398.478,
      "end": 403.302,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jeremy was a little disappointed by this but he did as his daughter asked."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 70,
      "start": 403.652,
      "end": 407.708,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "On the way home, he asked Jenny if she had enjoyed the speech."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 71,
      "start": 408.058,
      "end": 411.274,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "To his surprise, she said she hadn't."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 72,
      "start": 411.624,
      "end": 417.912,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Jeremy asked her why this was so and she told him that she did not like to see so many people laughing at him!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 73,
      "start": 418.262,
      "end": 421.086,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一组词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "circle"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 74,
      "start": 421.436,
      "end": 423.116,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Circle"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 75,
      "start": 423.466,
      "end": 429.249,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这一课里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "circle"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是几何里的圆，而是朋友圈。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 76,
      "start": 429.599,
      "end": 433.919,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A large circle of friends"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是朋友圈很广。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 77,
      "start": 434.269,
      "end": 439.573,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 还"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "is very popular at parties"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，在聚会上很受欢迎。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 78,
      "start": 439.923,
      "end": 446.255,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "大家"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "admire him for his great sense of humour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，因为他的幽默感而欣赏他。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 79,
      "start": 446.604,
      "end": 451.164,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后有一个小转折："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "except Jenny"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，除了 Jenny。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 80,
      "start": 451.514,
      "end": 458.714,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "circle"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这一组词帮你看见 Jeremy 的社交能力：friends, popular, admire, humour, except。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 81,
      "start": 459.064,
      "end": 462.008,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二组词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 82,
      "start": 462.358,
      "end": 464.038,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 83,
      "start": 464.388,
      "end": 470.508,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Make a speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是致辞、发表讲话，也可以连接到 school presentation。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 84,
      "start": 470.858,
      "end": 478.201,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Wedding reception"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是婚礼仪式之后的聚会或宴会，不是仪式本身。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 85,
      "start": 478.551,
      "end": 483.327,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The sort of thing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是“这种事情、这一类活动”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 86,
      "start": 483.677,
      "end": 489.973,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 喜欢这种活动，但他也认真准备："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He prepared the speech carefully"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 87,
      "start": 490.323,
      "end": 497.483,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "speech"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以这课不是说“天生会讲就够了”，而是说：好的表达可以准备，可以练习。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 88,
      "start": 497.833,
      "end": 500.913,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三组词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "amused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 89,
      "start": 501.263,
      "end": 502.991,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Amused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 90,
      "start": 503.34,
      "end": 507.58,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Amused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是觉得有趣、被逗乐。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 91,
      "start": 507.93,
      "end": 517.098,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "标题"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "She was not amused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不只是“她没有笑”，而是 Jenny 不觉得这件事好笑，也有点不高兴。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 92,
      "start": 517.448,
      "end": 527.32,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Jeremy 的 speech 是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a great success"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，可是 Jenny 想回家，所以 Jeremy"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was a little disappointed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 93,
      "start": 527.67,
      "end": 534.101,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "To his surprise"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "带出转折：他本来以为 Jenny 会喜欢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 94,
      "start": 534.451,
      "end": 537.707,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后重点是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laughing at him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 95,
      "start": 538.057,
      "end": 546.153,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "amused"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Laugh at someone"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可能是嘲笑；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "laugh with someone"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是一起笑、善意地笑。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 96,
      "start": 546.503,
      "end": 550.583,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天的语法板块叫：别人说了什么、问了什么。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 97,
      "start": 550.933,
      "end": 554.621,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一块："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "ask someone to do something"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 98,
      "start": 554.97,
      "end": 560.554,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "例句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "One of Jeremy's closest friends asked him to make a speech"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 99,
      "start": 560.904,
      "end": 565.144,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "请某人做某事，就可以用 ask 加人加 to do。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 100,
      "start": 565.494,
      "end": 569.35,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二块："
        },
        {
